the Honorable the Chancellor of the State of <st1:State w:st="on">Delaware</st1:State>, 
now sitting at <st1:City w:st="on">Dover</st1:City>, in and for the <st1:place
w:st="on"><st1:PlaceType w:st="on">County</st1:PlaceType> of <st1:PlaceName
 w:st="on">Kent</st1:PlaceName></st1:place>, as Judge of the Orphans’ Court, this 
fourteenth day of August in the year of our Lord, <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'>one thousand eight hundred and eleven</b>.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>THE 
PETITION OF <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Elizabeth Conselor</b> widow 
and Relict of<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'> Jeremiah Conselor</b> late 
of Little Creek Hundred in the County aforesaid Humbly sheweth, that the said 
<b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Jeremiah Conselor</b> was seized in his demesne 
as of fee of and in a certain plantation, tract or parcel of land, containing 
about one hundred and eighty acres, with the appurtenances, situate in the hundred 
and county aforesaid, adjoining land of <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'>Joseph Farrow</b> the heirs of <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Risdon 
Bishop</b> and others, which is subject to the widows dower therein, the whole 
of which will yield an annual Rent of about one hundred &amp; twenty dollars per 
year that being so thereof seized died, intestate leaving a widow and five children 
namely <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Esther Conselor</b>, <b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Elijah Conselor</b>, <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'>Hannah</b> <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Conselor</b>, <b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Harrieta Conselor</b> and <b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Jeremiah Conselor</b> who are all under the 
age of Fourteen years and hath no guardians, and as to personal Estate it is yet 
ascertained, but suppose it not be to any great amount He therefore prays your 
Honor to appoint her Guardian to said Minors agreeably to the directions of the 
act of Assembly in such case made and provided,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:3'>                                                                        
</span>And your petitioner will pray, &amp;c.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:3'>                                                                        
</span><st1:City
w:st="on"><st1:place w:st="on"><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Elizabeth</b></st1:place></st1:City> 
(her mark) <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Conselor<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'>Cover page:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>Petition 
for Guardian to be appointed for <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Esther</b>, 
<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Elijah</b>, <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'>Hannah</b>, <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Harrieta &amp;</b> 
<b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Jeremiah Conselor</b>, minors of Jeremiah 
Conselor decd.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>14 
August 1811, Elizabeth Conselor is appointed Guardian of her children<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><span
style='mso-tab-count:2'>                                                            
</span>Esther Conselor<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><span
style='mso-tab-count:2'>                                                            
</span>Elijah Conselor<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><span
style='mso-tab-count:2'>                                                            
</span>Hannah</span></b><span
style='font-family:Arial'> <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Conselor<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><span
style='mso-tab-count:2'>                                                            
</span>Harrieta Conselor<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><span
style='mso-tab-count:2'>                                                            
</span>Jeremiah Conselor<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:Arial'><span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>Elijah Conselor </span></b><span
style='font-family:Arial'>the chosen Trusty<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>Take 
Bond cash in 1000 Dlls<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;tab-stops:.5in 2.5in'><span
style='font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>Recorded 
G Folio 113.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
